WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:01.355
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:01.625 --> 01:06.225
Taming The Husband

3
01:06.625 --> 01:08.825
Episode 9

4
01:10.105 --> 01:12.225
Madam, please let me go!

5
01:12.305 --> 01:15.225
I've learned my manners. I won't disgrace the family.

6
01:16.105 --> 01:17.145
I promise.

7
01:19.305 --> 01:21.865
The Xie family The Su family

8
01:27.825 --> 01:29.425
Grain Transport Wharf

9
01:29.865 --> 01:31.865
The Yang family The Xie family

10
01:32.465 --> 01:33.905
The incense has burned out!

11
01:34.305 --> 01:36.145
The Bai family, 30 sacks.

12
01:36.545 --> 01:38.225
The Xie family, 21 sacks.

13
01:38.665 --> 01:40.225
The Su family, 19 sacks.

14
01:40.625 --> 01:42.425
The Su family is eliminated.

15
01:42.665 --> 01:47.065
Good! Good! Good! Good!

16
01:47.545 --> 01:48.545
Good!

17
01:48.665 --> 01:49.665
Good!

18
02:06.585 --> 02:07.585
Be careful, all of you.

19
02:15.865 --> 02:17.625
If only she knew how to fight.

20
02:17.705 --> 02:19.145
Don't get ahead of yourself.

21
02:19.225 --> 02:20.225
Focus on what's in front of you.

22
02:20.305 --> 02:21.305
Who asked you?

23
02:22.905 --> 02:26.425
The third contest is Seize the Prize.

24
02:26.945 --> 02:30.505
Climb the poles and take the ball.

25
02:30.985 --> 02:32.905
Each family sends four people.

26
02:32.985 --> 02:34.465
There's no time limit.

27
02:34.545 --> 02:38.745
The first to bring the ball ashore wins.

28
02:38.825 --> 02:41.105
If you fall to the ground,

29
02:41.185 --> 02:44.505
you're out of the contest.

30
02:53.185 --> 02:54.425
Everyone, gather around.

31
02:54.505 --> 02:55.745
Listen.

32
02:56.345 --> 02:57.705
Here's our plan.

33
02:58.505 --> 02:59.505
You're a Xie, too?

34
03:00.385 --> 03:02.385
What's the big deal? What's there to discuss?

35
03:03.665 --> 03:05.545
Junmei, what are they doing?

36
03:06.225 --> 03:07.945
Putting on a show. Ignore them.

37
03:08.465 --> 03:09.745
Just do as I told you.

38
03:22.465 --> 03:24.505
Begin!

39
03:24.585 --> 03:25.825
Grain Transport Wharf

40
03:30.385 --> 03:33.025
Yi, you and Bai Junmei are the best fighters,

41
03:33.265 --> 03:34.425
and you've still got plenty of strength.

42
03:34.505 --> 03:35.505
You're the top horses.

43
03:35.865 --> 03:38.985
Your job is to beat their middle horse, Huang Yulan.

44
03:39.745 --> 03:41.505
My old injury's back. I'm exhausted.

45
03:42.065 --> 03:44.185
That makes me our weakest horse. I'll keep Bai Junmei occupied.

46
03:44.985 --> 03:47.825
Qiao, reach the top in seven and a half minutes.

47
03:47.985 --> 03:50.225
Shake off their weakest horse and take the prize.

48
03:59.145 --> 04:00.705
Lose today. There's always tomorrow.

49
04:00.945 --> 04:02.505
Your back injury still hasn't healed.

50
04:03.065 --> 04:04.105
That bright future of yours

51
04:04.265 --> 04:05.585
could be ruined for good.

52
04:10.625 --> 04:11.785
You'll stop at nothing.

53
04:12.225 --> 04:14.265
Not long left to live, have you?

54
04:29.545 --> 04:30.545
Heng!

55
04:33.625 --> 04:35.305
Heng!

56
04:35.425 --> 04:36.825
Go and see if he's hurt!

57
04:37.145 --> 04:39.225
What are you waiting for?

58
04:39.865 --> 04:41.105
Hurry!

59
04:51.745 --> 04:53.825
Never mind me. Keep looking ahead!

60
04:55.265 --> 04:57.025
You've already used up a lot of strength.

61
04:57.185 --> 04:58.185
Still got any fight left?

62
04:58.865 --> 05:00.265
Stop barking at me!

63
05:00.865 --> 05:01.865
Get him!

64
05:10.425 --> 05:11.425
Who are you?

65
05:12.585 --> 05:13.785
Your worst nightmare!

66
05:14.025 --> 05:16.865
This… this is madness!

67
05:17.105 --> 05:18.825
Someone! Get her down!

68
05:18.905 --> 05:20.465
Uncle, I sent her.

69
05:20.545 --> 05:22.545
You… just look at that son of yours!

70
05:23.305 --> 05:25.625
Losing is one thing. But she could be killed!

71
05:25.705 --> 05:27.865
Taking a risk beats sitting here waiting to lose.

72
05:29.145 --> 05:30.145
Sit down, all of you!

73
05:30.425 --> 05:31.425
But--

74
05:31.905 --> 05:34.745
Panicking like this is a disgrace!

75
05:35.385 --> 05:37.625
Get him! Give him everything you've got!

76
05:38.025 --> 05:39.905
We're just having a friendly match.

77
05:40.225 --> 05:42.185
Why take it so personally, miss?

78
05:54.745 --> 05:55.865
You?

79
05:56.945 --> 05:57.945
Me.

80
06:03.185 --> 06:04.305
All show, no strength.

81
06:04.385 --> 06:05.425
You'll never make it.

82
06:07.705 --> 06:08.985
Are you afraid of heights?

83
06:15.105 --> 06:16.105
Watch out!

84
06:16.505 --> 06:17.505
Jianwei!

85
06:17.585 --> 06:18.585
I'm here.

86
06:20.505 --> 06:21.785
Chilly up there, isn't it?

87
06:50.425 --> 06:52.625
Left foot, right foot.

88
06:54.785 --> 06:56.385
Left, right.

89
06:57.425 --> 06:59.225
Left, right.

90
07:00.305 --> 07:01.625
Putting on a show.

91
07:04.345 --> 07:06.105
Left, right. Left, right.

92
07:06.185 --> 07:07.185
Left, right.

93
07:07.825 --> 07:09.545
Lift your left foot, then your right.

94
07:09.625 --> 07:11.745
Walk faster and faster. Faster and faster.

95
07:11.825 --> 07:13.665
Run faster and faster. Faster and faster.

96
07:13.865 --> 07:14.865
Careful!

97
07:20.385 --> 07:22.505
Suddenly, he swings a punch at you.

98
07:22.585 --> 07:24.745
You dodge quickly, left and right, with quick little steps,

99
07:24.905 --> 07:26.105
and avoid the blow.

100
07:29.625 --> 07:30.625
Are you mad?

101
07:30.705 --> 07:32.785
It's an embroidered ball! Is it worth dying for?

102
07:34.585 --> 07:36.425
My life's worth nothing anyway!

103
07:41.385 --> 07:42.785
Plant your feet,

104
07:47.225 --> 07:49.345
lift your leg, and kick, again and again!

105
07:53.305 --> 07:54.305
Catch the rope!

106
08:04.065 --> 08:07.825
Baozhu, show them how much of this world

107
08:07.945 --> 08:10.425
they still know nothing about!

108
08:16.545 --> 08:17.545
Junmei!

109
08:29.825 --> 08:32.625
Full Granaries

110
08:43.385 --> 08:44.425
Baozhu!

111
08:47.105 --> 08:48.105
Someone help!

112
09:02.865 --> 09:04.465
Young Master Xie's on his feet!

113
09:07.185 --> 09:08.345
Am I seeing things?

114
09:08.905 --> 09:10.145
He really is standing!

115
09:11.705 --> 09:12.745
His legs are better!

116
09:14.545 --> 09:15.545
My lord!

117
09:16.065 --> 09:17.065
Stay back!

118
09:57.425 --> 09:59.225
She's out! She's safe!

119
10:31.385 --> 10:33.345
The Bai family The Xie family

120
11:09.225 --> 11:10.225
Good work.

121
11:35.385 --> 11:36.425
The Bai family The Xie family

122
11:41.945 --> 11:44.505
At this year's shipping festival,

123
11:44.705 --> 11:47.225
the Xies are our champions!

124
11:47.505 --> 11:50.385
Here is Yangzhou Prefecture's decree.

125
11:50.905 --> 11:53.585
From this day on, between Yangzhou and the capital,

126
11:53.905 --> 11:57.625
all priority government grain shipments

127
11:58.025 --> 12:01.385
will be handled solely by the Xie family.

128
12:01.465 --> 12:02.665
Good!

129
12:02.745 --> 12:04.985
We thank His Majesty for his favor.

130
12:05.145 --> 12:06.145
-Good! -Good!

131
12:17.185 --> 12:18.185
My lord!

132
12:18.425 --> 12:21.145
The contest's over! Why are you still hitting people?

133
12:21.585 --> 12:22.825
-I… -You…

134
12:22.905 --> 12:25.825
-You… -Shameless! You filthy cheat!

135
12:27.625 --> 12:28.625
Are you all right, my lord?

136
12:28.705 --> 12:30.825
Baozhu. Enough.

137
12:31.105 --> 12:33.745
Get changed, before you catch a cold.

138
12:34.425 --> 12:36.145
Junmei, are you all right?

139
12:36.745 --> 12:37.745
You…

140
12:47.825 --> 12:50.025
The Xie estate

141
12:50.425 --> 12:52.625
Yesterday, Xie Yan was calling in debts.

142
12:52.705 --> 12:54.025
Today he's on his feet.

143
12:54.225 --> 12:56.705
And tomorrow, he'll want a slice of our business!

144
12:57.625 --> 13:00.625
We're one family. His success is ours, too.

145
13:01.225 --> 13:03.705
We each have our own household.

146
13:04.025 --> 13:06.185
Even brothers keep separate accounts.

147
13:06.345 --> 13:09.185
Qiao only handles odd jobs at the docks.

148
13:09.945 --> 13:12.225
Yi works the short routes with me.

149
13:12.545 --> 13:14.105
He can still get some

150
13:14.305 --> 13:15.425
private allowance out of me.

151
13:16.145 --> 13:18.265
At least I have a son, too.

152
13:18.345 --> 13:20.225
And mine works the long routes!

153
13:20.625 --> 13:23.785
But now here comes Xie Yan!

154
13:24.345 --> 13:26.025
How am I supposed to compete?

155
13:27.625 --> 13:30.945
Tell me, you couldn't even give me a son!

156
13:31.345 --> 13:33.465
Are you sure it's my fault and not yours?

157
13:33.545 --> 13:34.705
Hard to say, isn't it?

158
13:35.025 --> 13:36.105
Enough, enough!

159
13:36.705 --> 13:37.705
Honestly!

160
13:40.385 --> 13:42.385
You only see that he has two sons.

161
13:42.745 --> 13:45.425
But you take all the money from the short routes and the docks.

162
13:45.825 --> 13:48.425
Your brother-in-law only has the long routes.

163
13:48.625 --> 13:49.625
Of course he'd want his share.

164
13:50.225 --> 13:51.825
If he hadn't come back to Yangzhou,

165
13:52.105 --> 13:53.825
I'd have the long routes, too!

166
13:55.665 --> 13:58.025
What was Mother thinking, making such a mess of things?

167
13:59.145 --> 14:00.825
She sent Heng off on the ships

168
14:01.785 --> 14:03.825
and put his two sons under me instead.

169
14:04.105 --> 14:05.745
Now it's all a mess!

170
14:06.985 --> 14:08.425
You help each other and keep each other honest.

171
14:09.025 --> 14:10.385
That's not such a bad thing.

172
14:10.625 --> 14:11.905
Not bad?

173
14:12.385 --> 14:14.545
Now he's sent another son over!

174
14:14.825 --> 14:16.625
How are we supposed to compete?

175
14:17.625 --> 14:19.265
If Heng married someone in the trade,

176
14:19.345 --> 14:21.625
I'd get a few more routes.

177
14:22.105 --> 14:24.305
But Heng simply won't marry!

178
14:25.105 --> 14:27.025
Every branch has its own interests.

179
14:27.305 --> 14:29.385
And within each branch, people have their own interests, too.

180
14:29.785 --> 14:31.025
No need to rush.

181
14:31.985 --> 14:33.985
Someone else is more worried than we are.

182
14:34.985 --> 14:36.465
Heng! I'm off.

183
14:46.905 --> 14:48.185
Heng! Heng!

184
14:48.745 --> 14:49.745
You…

185
14:55.225 --> 14:56.865
Quiet virtue brings good fortune

186
14:56.945 --> 14:58.505
Come on, come on, come on. Let's raise our cups

187
14:58.585 --> 15:00.785
to the Xies reclaiming the title!

188
15:01.225 --> 15:02.385
Congratulations! Congratulations, sir!

189
15:02.505 --> 15:03.705
Congratulations to the Xie family!

190
15:07.065 --> 15:08.065
Yan.

191
15:13.145 --> 15:14.145
Here, Yan.

192
15:15.625 --> 15:16.625
Have some more.

193
15:18.145 --> 15:19.225
I don't like fish.

194
15:22.825 --> 15:25.945
Then… let's have a drink, just you and me.

195
15:26.025 --> 15:27.025
I don't drink, either.

196
15:29.545 --> 15:30.545
Yan,

197
15:30.705 --> 15:32.705
Father's put together all this food and wine for you.

198
15:32.785 --> 15:34.105
What's with the attitude?

199
15:34.305 --> 15:35.545
If you won't eat, I will.

200
15:37.705 --> 15:39.385
Baozhu's still laid up in bed,

201
15:39.825 --> 15:41.585
and you're in the mood for this little performance?

202
15:42.305 --> 15:43.785
Go on, eat as much as you like.

203
15:44.225 --> 15:45.225
At least it'll shut you up.

204
15:45.305 --> 15:46.305
Yan,

205
15:46.505 --> 15:49.505
it's one thing to snub Xi and me day after day.

206
15:50.665 --> 15:51.825
But Father's done nothing to you!

207
15:51.905 --> 15:52.905
Qiao!

208
15:53.505 --> 15:57.785
Then ask him how I hurt my legs.

209
16:01.505 --> 16:02.985
Weren't you riding with Father

210
16:03.065 --> 16:04.185
when you fell off and hurt your legs?

211
16:04.265 --> 16:06.545
Yes. Didn't you just fall off by accident?

212
16:06.625 --> 16:09.345
Enough, Xi. Stop fighting with your brother.

213
16:09.425 --> 16:10.425
I…

214
16:25.545 --> 16:27.785
Yan, you…

215
16:42.065 --> 16:43.225
Help your brother.

216
16:43.425 --> 16:44.425
-Sit down and eat, -Yan.

217
16:45.105 --> 16:46.105
Sit.

218
16:57.385 --> 16:59.025
Who could put up with that temper?

219
16:59.105 --> 17:02.505
-What did you say? -Enough. Eat.

220
17:03.785 --> 17:04.785
Let's eat.

221
17:04.905 --> 17:05.905
Eat up.

222
17:22.065 --> 17:23.265
You're spending the night here?

223
17:26.905 --> 17:27.905
You can go.

224
17:28.825 --> 17:30.385
What about Lady Jin?

225
17:32.825 --> 17:35.465
Actually, one of the matrons gave me a little booklet.

226
17:39.905 --> 17:40.905
Gently.

227
17:41.065 --> 17:42.065
All right.

228
18:48.425 --> 18:49.425
Thank you.

229
18:51.465 --> 18:52.465
Jin Baozhu.

230
20:03.345 --> 20:04.985
Left, right.

231
20:06.105 --> 20:08.465
Left foot, right foot.

232
20:10.025 --> 20:12.345
Left foot, right foot.

233
20:13.745 --> 20:15.905
Left, right foot.

234
20:17.385 --> 20:19.345
Left foot, right foot.

235
20:19.425 --> 20:20.425
Xie Yan.

236
20:21.305 --> 20:23.025
Which story are we acting out today?

237
20:23.625 --> 20:25.905
We're chasing dogs today.

238
20:27.345 --> 20:29.265
Didn't you say that in this courtyard,

239
20:29.345 --> 20:31.785
any word about legs was forbidden?

240
20:32.225 --> 20:33.905
Today I'm saying every last one!

241
20:34.025 --> 20:35.625
I run! I jump!

242
20:35.785 --> 20:37.425
-I kick! I leap! -I pace!

243
20:37.545 --> 20:39.745
I stride! I walk like I'm flying!

244
20:39.825 --> 20:40.985
I leap wherever I please!

245
20:41.185 --> 20:42.425
I climb mountains! Cross rivers!

246
20:42.505 --> 20:43.745
Like it's a stroll in the park!

247
20:43.825 --> 20:45.185
I push off!

248
20:45.345 --> 20:48.145
I spring up! And sail over Golden Dragon Gate!

249
20:53.105 --> 20:56.025
I'm hungry. I want dragon liver and phoenix marrow!

250
20:56.145 --> 20:58.025
Sea cucumber and shark fin, abalone and fish maw!

251
20:58.545 --> 20:59.985
Ready to eat, Your Majesty?

252
21:01.425 --> 21:02.985
If you haven't got either,

253
21:03.585 --> 21:07.145
could I have a plum drink with honey?

254
21:07.225 --> 21:09.945
Preferably from the ice cellar, chilled overnight.

255
21:10.625 --> 21:11.865
Still want your cakes?

256
21:11.945 --> 21:12.945
Yes! Yes!

257
21:13.185 --> 21:15.825
A bag of osmanthus cakes, freshly steamed, please.

258
21:16.825 --> 21:18.225
It's only the third lunar month.

259
21:18.305 --> 21:19.985
Where am I supposed to get osmanthus?

260
21:21.425 --> 21:23.025
I'm still ill, you know.

261
21:23.625 --> 21:25.905
A few little requests, and you can't take it?

262
21:26.145 --> 21:28.225
I think you're the one who wants to be emperor!

263
21:31.625 --> 21:34.225
Back in those days

264
21:34.785 --> 21:38.185
Proud and fierce upon my dappled horse

265
21:38.505 --> 21:42.425
Enemy blood upon my scarlet skirt

266
21:51.665 --> 21:52.665
Eat.

267
22:07.105 --> 22:08.625
He's been spoiled all his life.

268
22:08.705 --> 22:10.585
Only you, my lady, can get him to do a thing.

269
22:13.105 --> 22:14.105
What are you staring at?

270
22:15.705 --> 22:16.985
His Majesty.

271
22:20.065 --> 22:21.865
The Xie ancestral hall

272
22:30.345 --> 22:31.785
Yan's legs

273
22:32.625 --> 22:34.425
are finally getting better.

274
22:35.225 --> 22:38.825
Everything's well at home now.

275
22:39.945 --> 22:41.305
I wonder

276
22:44.705 --> 22:46.505
if you're at peace now.

277
23:14.105 --> 23:16.665
Hanzhang

278
23:16.905 --> 23:18.585
It's been 24 years.

279
23:21.025 --> 23:26.545
Why have the Xies never acknowledged her as family?

280
23:28.105 --> 23:29.185
She met an untimely end.

281
23:30.225 --> 23:31.505
The rites should be simple.

282
23:40.865 --> 23:41.865
Careful.

283
23:44.265 --> 23:47.345
Hanzhang, come here.

284
23:50.505 --> 23:51.505
Mother.

285
23:53.625 --> 23:54.625
My lord.

286
23:55.585 --> 23:56.785
She's gone.

287
23:57.625 --> 23:59.225
Don't wear yourself out grieving.

288
24:00.385 --> 24:03.305
You should get some rest.

289
25:08.465 --> 25:10.865
Virtue sustains all things

290
25:19.145 --> 25:20.425
You're here late.

291
25:21.105 --> 25:22.625
Were you visiting your mother?

292
25:24.825 --> 25:25.825
I was.

293
25:29.425 --> 25:32.025
My respects, Grandmother.

294
25:33.505 --> 25:34.505
Come, sit down.

295
25:35.745 --> 25:36.745
Thank you, Grandmother.

296
25:40.105 --> 25:42.025
How are your legs?

297
25:45.385 --> 25:48.185
I can walk a little, but I'm slow.

298
25:48.785 --> 25:50.305
I still need daily practice.

299
25:52.145 --> 25:54.825
Well? You came here especially.

300
25:55.385 --> 25:57.945
Something on your mind?

301
25:58.425 --> 26:00.025
You know me so well, Grandmother,

302
26:01.105 --> 26:02.305
so I'll get to the point.

303
26:11.025 --> 26:14.385
I owe my recovery entirely to Baozhu.

304
26:15.025 --> 26:16.145
You taught me,

305
26:16.825 --> 26:19.305
"Give without keeping score. Never forget a kindness."

306
26:20.585 --> 26:23.185
So I ask for your permission

307
26:24.025 --> 26:25.745
to make Jin Baozhu my principal wife.

308
26:29.425 --> 26:30.865
Baozhu has done us a great service.

309
26:31.625 --> 26:34.025
She'll be well rewarded.

310
26:34.785 --> 26:38.625
But making her your principal wife, isn't appropriate.

311
26:39.385 --> 26:41.225
You're a legitimate Xie grandson.

312
26:41.385 --> 26:43.945
You can't marry just anyone.

313
26:44.625 --> 26:46.945
She risked her life for the family.

314
26:47.345 --> 26:50.265
You must make sacrifices for it, too.

315
26:51.305 --> 26:54.825
Otherwise, all her efforts will have been wasted.

316
26:57.425 --> 26:58.825
Since you mean to reward her,

317
27:00.145 --> 27:01.505
there's something else I'd like to ask.

318
27:05.345 --> 27:07.945
You mean Madam's ordered

319
27:08.305 --> 27:09.505
that at next month's ancestral ceremony,

320
27:09.705 --> 27:11.185
she's to cast the divination blocks?

321
27:11.305 --> 27:12.425
Not just that.

322
27:12.825 --> 27:14.505
She can wear a red ribbon in her hair!

323
27:15.105 --> 27:18.225
I hear Yan went to Madam and asked her himself.

324
27:18.305 --> 27:20.425
He asked for money and shops,

325
27:20.585 --> 27:23.265
and even for that Song fellow's letter of recommendation.

326
27:24.225 --> 27:28.425
Madam refused and sent him off with some money.

327
27:28.505 --> 27:29.905
Can she even run a shop?

328
27:29.985 --> 27:31.505
That's what Madam asked.

329
27:31.985 --> 27:33.185
Yan had nothing to say to that.

330
27:33.865 --> 27:35.745
Before he left, he took

331
27:35.825 --> 27:37.465
a hefty silver reward from family funds,

332
27:37.585 --> 27:39.585
and a full set of gold jewelry!

333
27:39.705 --> 27:40.705
Honestly!

334
27:42.185 --> 27:45.865
Whatever Madam decides, just do as she says.

335
27:46.665 --> 27:51.025
Dressing up in red and green is a principal wife's privilege.

336
27:51.985 --> 27:53.785
Yet she's been allowed to!

337
27:54.425 --> 27:58.105
Is Madam planning to make her the principal wife?

338
27:58.625 --> 28:00.825
A principal wife must be a proper match.

339
28:01.665 --> 28:03.465
Madam wouldn't do that.

340
28:07.385 --> 28:09.505
And casting blocks in the ancestral hall?

341
28:09.865 --> 28:12.585
Only someone who's done the family a great service gets that honor.

342
28:12.985 --> 28:13.985
She doesn't deserve it!

343
28:14.825 --> 28:17.065
Why is she the one chosen this year?

344
28:17.505 --> 28:18.905
What gives her the right?

345
28:19.425 --> 28:20.945
Because...

346
28:22.065 --> 28:25.505
she truly cares about Yan, and about this family.

347
28:26.105 --> 28:27.505
Don't we all?

348
28:28.305 --> 28:29.505
Don't you and I?

349
28:30.465 --> 28:32.065
And my two children?

350
28:32.585 --> 28:34.665
They fight over one thing, then the next.

351
28:35.985 --> 28:37.625
And your Yi?

352
28:38.705 --> 28:42.305
Tell me, even if you won't think of yourself,

353
28:42.625 --> 28:44.265
what about your child?

354
28:46.905 --> 28:48.865
Look at me. I'm always ill.

355
28:49.505 --> 28:51.185
I can barely look after him.

356
28:51.825 --> 28:55.505
Yi's caught a cold, and I don't dare go near him.

357
28:56.585 --> 28:58.025
I'm afraid I'd pass something on.

358
29:00.825 --> 29:02.345
When the master came back recently,

359
29:02.425 --> 29:03.785
he brought a little datura,

360
29:04.105 --> 29:05.705
for me to share among the courtyards.

361
29:06.105 --> 29:08.425
It's very good for colds.

362
29:16.305 --> 29:17.425
Have you handed it out?

363
29:18.505 --> 29:21.185
I've been so busy, I haven't had a moment to myself.

364
29:21.265 --> 29:22.625
When would I have had the chance?

365
29:23.105 --> 29:26.185
They say this medicine is hard to get, even with money.

366
29:26.985 --> 29:29.585
Just the tiniest bit works wonders.

367
29:29.865 --> 29:32.305
But you must never mix it with other medicines.

368
29:32.465 --> 29:34.905
The wrong combination could be very serious.

369
29:49.385 --> 29:50.425
It's really for me?

370
29:51.545 --> 29:52.985
Is it pure gold?

371
29:53.305 --> 29:54.985
I heard gold's very soft.

372
29:56.545 --> 29:58.145
Pure gold wouldn't survive you.

373
29:58.385 --> 29:59.545
It's gold over iron.

374
30:05.065 --> 30:07.345
Here. Let me put it on you.

375
30:16.265 --> 30:17.265
Pretty?

376
30:21.825 --> 30:22.825
Beautiful.

377
30:23.705 --> 30:24.705
Prettier than Diaochan.

378
30:25.825 --> 30:28.185
Who's she? When did you meet her?

379
30:35.625 --> 30:38.025
Where were you last night? You came back so late.

380
30:41.265 --> 30:42.825
Last night...

381
30:43.665 --> 30:45.105
was the anniversary of my mother's death.

382
30:48.305 --> 30:49.305
She died young.

383
30:50.225 --> 30:51.385
For as long as I can remember,

384
30:51.945 --> 30:53.945
it was my stepmother who raised me on her own.

385
30:55.025 --> 30:56.425
But I never felt alone.

386
30:57.025 --> 30:58.505
Mother left me so much.

387
30:59.505 --> 31:00.745
When I got into trouble as a child,

388
31:01.305 --> 31:02.505
kneeling alone as punishment,

389
31:03.985 --> 31:05.625
I'd trace these stitches

390
31:05.705 --> 31:07.825
and think about all sorts of things.

391
31:14.945 --> 31:16.145
It's beautiful embroidery.

392
31:17.185 --> 31:18.545
It must have taken so long.

393
31:18.945 --> 31:20.185
She must have loved you very much.

394
31:21.625 --> 31:22.785
But I keep wondering

395
31:25.385 --> 31:26.745
whether she was lonely.

396
31:37.985 --> 31:39.545
Why daylilies?

397
31:41.105 --> 31:42.425
They're said to take your worries away.

398
31:42.945 --> 31:44.905
That's why we call them "forget-your-worries flowers."

399
31:46.905 --> 31:48.625
The ancestral ceremony's coming up.

400
31:49.145 --> 31:51.025
And here in this house, a lot of people are watching us.

401
31:51.625 --> 31:53.025
Keep your eyes open, whatever you do.
